From 4973f70b46afe78ca9c4b32ea54a8ba4d3674f5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wangyunhua <wangyunhua3@contributor>


Date: Sun, 31 Aug 2025 07:50:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] BUGFIX User activities such as logins are not
 recorded when audit logging is not enabled

Issue:
------
User activities such as logins are not recorded when audit logging is not enabled.

Solution:
---------
1. rds_conn_log_error_verbosity = 0, disable, not log connection info
2. rds_conn_log_error_verbosity = 1, log abnormal connection setup and abnormal disconnection info.
3. rds_conn_log_error_verbosity = 2, log all connection info.
